            DOI: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1097/gme.0b013e31824d8f40" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">10.1097/gme.0b013e31824d8f40</a>
            <span class="block mt-0.5 text-ink/50">(STRAW+10 — menopoz evrelerinin uluslararası sınıflandırma referansı; ortalama yaş ve perimenopoz süresi.)</span>
          </li>
          <li id="kaynak-2">
            The NAMS 2022 Hormone Therapy Position Statement Advisory Panel. "The 2022 hormone therapy position statement of The Menopause Society."
            <em>Menopause</em>. 2022;29(7):767–794.
            PMID: <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35797481/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">35797481</a> ·
            DOI: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1097/GME.0000000000002028" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">10.1097/GME.0000000000002028</a>
            <span class="block mt-0.5 text-ink/50">(HRT karar rehberi, vazomotor belirti verileri, bireysel risk-fayda dengesi.)</span>
          </li>
          <li id="kaynak-3">
            Randolph JF Jr et al. "Change in follicle-stimulating hormone and estradiol across the menopausal transition."
            <em>J Clin Endocrinol Metab</em>. 2011;96(3):746–754.
            PMID: <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21159842/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">21159842</a> ·
            DOI: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1210/jc.2010-1746" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">10.1210/jc.2010-1746</a>
            <span class="block mt-0.5 text-ink/50">(FSH yükselişi ve östrojen düşüşünün longitudinal verileri.)</span>
          </li>
          <li id="kaynak-4">
            Greendale GA et al. "Changes in body composition and weight during the menopause transition."
            <em>JCI Insight</em>. 2019;4(5):e124865.
            PMID: <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30843880/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">30843880</a> ·
            DOI: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1172/jci.insight.124865" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">10.1172/jci.insight.124865</a>
            <span class="block mt-0.5 text-ink/50">(Perimenopoz–postmenopoz geçişinde metabolik ve vücut kompozisyonu değişimleri; SWAN kohort.)</span>
          </li>
          <li id="kaynak-5">
            Cauley JA. "Estrogen and bone health in men and women."
            <em>Steroids</em>. 2015;99(Pt A):11–15.
            PMID: <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25555470/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">25555470</a> ·
            DOI: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.steroids.2014.12.010" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">10.1016/j.steroids.2014.12.010</a>
